  "name": "Generative UI",
  "repo": "CopilotKit/CopilotKit",
  "homepage": "https://ag-ui.com",
  "what": "Generative UI is the pattern where an agent's output is not text but UI — the model emits a structured spec (often JSON or an event stream), and the client renders it with real components. It replaces 'here is a wall of markdown' with 'here is the actual widget you asked for'."
 },
